## Container images mirrored into your ECR at deploy time (`make mirror`, `src/mirror/images.json`)

These are not redistributed by this repository; `make mirror` copies them from their public
registries into the deploying account, at the digests pinned in `images.json`.

| Image | Version | Upstream | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| argoproj/argocd | v3.4.7 | quay.io/argoproj | Apache-2.0 |
| valkey/valkey (Argo CD's cache) | 9.0.6-alpine | public.ecr.aws/valkey | BSD-3-Clause |
