Argo CD's upstream install manifest names its cache image as `redis:8.2.3-alpine`. Redis 8 is
licensed RSALv2 / SSPLv1 / AGPLv3, so `src/argo/render.sh` repoints that one reference at
Valkey (the Linux Foundation fork of the BSD-3-Clause Redis 7.2 codebase, protocol-compatible);
no Redis image is mirrored or run by this sample.

Base image for the sample's own containers (application, schema job, load generator):
